# Store all text files with LF line endings in the repo, on every OS.
# Prevents noisy "every line changed" diffs between Windows and Mac/Linux,
# and keeps Prettier (which expects LF) happy. See docs/06-development-workflow.md.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch line endings
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
